Error: this changes the monitor itself ($80000-$86FFF).
Add ! to do it anyway. The board then restarts with the new monitor.
> MM.L 10004 00012345
> FL 10000 4FFFF 80000 !
Flash ID $BFB6: SST39SF020A
Flash $80000-$BFFFF from RAM $10000: erase 1 sector(s), program 4077 byte(s)

Error: the new reset vector (flash offset 4) would be $00012345,
not an even address in the flash, so the board could not start.
Check the image and the FL addresses.
> MM.L 10004 00000000
> FL 10000 4FFFF 80000 !
